\begin{slide}
SIMLTIC: \textbf{SIM}ulation of \textbf{L}inear \textbf{T}ime-\textbf{I}nvariant \textbf{C}ovariance
\begin{itemize}
  \item Discrete, Generic Covariance Simulation
  \item LTI = Constant Copefficients in System Dynamics
  \item Implemented as Simulink Subsystem Block
	\begin{itemize}
		\item Can be dropped into higher level models as required
		\item Output can be integrated with Matlab Workspace
	\end{itemize}
\end{itemize} 
\end{slide}

